          "name": "book_slot",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:e34a2a62c38a47627e5e1ff521477de6d211a2a39e5d9b16777a724cb963bb90",
          "description": "Use this when you were about to book a slot in one step. This calendar does not have a one-step booking verb, and calling this tool never books anything. Booking is two steps so a confirmation cannot lose a race: call hold_slot to reserve the time, then commit_hold to confirm it. This tool exists only to tell you that.",
