          "name": "cancel_booking",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:1f0eba169500aa7a1a591873143a78da1676e79f09ed20361a81900fa600d860",
          "description": "Use this only when a human has asked for a confirmed booking to be cancelled. Permanently removes it and frees the slot for anyone else. Needs a booking_id from list_bookings or commit_hold, not a hold_id. To give up a slot you are only holding, use release_hold instead.",
